<title>USA: CCC buys 29,027 tonnes U.S. wheat for Bangladesh.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 29,027 tonnes U.S. wheat for Bangladesh.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of USDA (CCC) said it bought 29,027 tonnes of U.S. soft white wheat from United Grain Corp for donation to Bangladesh. Shipment was slated for September 10-October 5.</p>
<p>The wheat was priced at $190.82 to $191.69 a tonne, FOB.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
